# OpenGolem

- **Start here:** repository root `CLAUDE.md` (commands, key files, credentials, sentinel protocol).
- **Architecture and security model:** `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. **Roadmap / lineage:** `docs/PLAN_V1.md`.
- **Human-facing overview and credits:** `README.md` (NanoClaw / MicroClaw lineage; original direction and new work credited to Jim Moraga).
- Prefer **small, focused** changes; match existing naming and patterns; do not expand scope without an explicit request.
- After substantive TypeScript changes, run **`npm test`** when practical.
- Never commit secrets; keep credentials in local `.env` only.
